{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Floor13</i>, reality doesn\u2019t change all at once \u2014 it shifts quietly, waiting for you to notice.<br>You walk the same office corridor over and over, but something always feels\u2026 slightly off.<br>Your task is simple: <strong>observe, detect, report.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail to see the difference, the corridor will keep you forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Showcase</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Routine.</strong><br>You begin another ordinary walk through the corridor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105730/extras/91780d4bc3b15f8bba8dfe7214b1a65c.poster.avif?t=1761292357\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105730/extras/91780d4bc3b15f8bba8dfe7214b1a65c.webm?t=1761292357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105730/extras/91780d4bc3b15f8bba8dfe7214b1a65c.mp4?t=1761292357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distortion.</strong><br>Objects change, reality twists \u2014 can you tell what\u2019s wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105730/extras/040483cc69ca12f3d9013929c94a688f.poster.avif?t=1761292357\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105730/extras/040483cc69ca12f3d9013929c94a688f.webm?t=1761292357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105730/extras/040483cc69ca12f3d9013929c94a688f.mp4?t=1761292357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Judgment.</strong><br>Use your clipboard to identify the anomaly\u2019s <strong>type</strong> and <strong>location</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105730/extras/bee8e08ec5374252617fdbdb203d75ea.poster.avif?t=1761292357\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105730/extras/bee8e08ec5374252617fdbdb203d75ea.webm?t=1761292357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105730/extras/bee8e08ec5374252617fdbdb203d75ea.mp4?t=1761292357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric psychological horror focused on observation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loop-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic visuals using Unreal Engine 5 with Lumen and MetaHuman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design with subtle ambient tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat. No escape. Only awareness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-60 minutes</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4105730?t=1761292357","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105730/cc04ea97324d0e7cf534df568cf32eafd5082c1f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761292357","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105730/534b4e6ec775bb593dadd890a84b54db66868a81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761292357","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.st